# Personal docs & config (resume, your compiled profile) — keep out of public repo.
# Each forker creates their own profile.json from profile.example.json; only the
# example is committed. To have your fork's GitHub Actions use them, force-add in
# your own fork: git add -f profile.json profile.compiled.json
docs/*.pdf
profile.json
profile.compiled.json
